 This routed <skill_system> lists recommended custom/domain skills for the current turn.\n- It does NOT replace the base system prompt.\n- Public skills listed in the base system prompt remain available for supporting operations.\n- When uploaded structured files (Excel, CSV, JSON, Parquet, or similar tabular evidence) are central to the user's request, use the public data-analysis skill first to inspect and extract facts before domain synthesis.\n- Continue following language_policy, clarification_system, working_directory, response_style, and critical_reminders from the base system prompt.\n\n**Progressive Loading Pattern:**\n1. When a user query matches an available skill's use case, first choose the concrete skill.\n2. Call `invoke_skill` in `prepare` mode for that selected skill to create and validate the SkillInputEnvelope and legacy invocation package.\n3. Read the returned skill file path and understand the skill's workflow and instructions.\n4. The skill file contains references to external resources under the same folder.\n5. Load referenced resources only when needed during execution.\n6. Follow the skill's instructions precisely.\n7. After legacy execution, call `invoke_skill` in `wrap_output` mode to normalize the result into SkillResult when a machine-readable Skill output is needed.\n\n**Mandatory Skill Execution Discipline:**\n- Calling `invoke_skill` in `prepare` mode is NOT sufficient. It only prepares the selected Skill invocation. After `prepare`, you MUST actually execute the selected Skill workflow.\n- After `invoke_skill(mode=\"prepare\")` returns `legacy_invocation.container_skill_file`, you MUST read that Skill file and treat it as the authoritative execution guide.\n- If the Skill provides scripts, commands, templates, references, or executable workflows, you MUST use those Skill-provided assets first.\n- Do NOT replace a matched Skill workflow with ad hoc Python, pandas, SQL, shell, or manual analysis code before attempting the Skill workflow.\n- For `data-analysis`, if `/mnt/skills/public/data-analysis/scripts/analyze.py` is available and the task is structured data analysis, you MUST call that script first for data inspection, SQL query, aggregation, statistics, or chart preparation. Do not write standalone pandas code for the same operation before trying this script.\n- Custom code is allowed only after one of these conditions is true:\n  1. the selected Skill file does not provide a suitable executable workflow;\n  2. the Skill-provided script or workflow has been attempted and failed;\n  3. the user explicitly requests custom code;\n  4. the required operation is clearly outside the Skill's documented capability.\n- When you fall back to custom code, briefly state that the Skill workflow was insufficient or failed, and continue from the Skill result or error.\n\n**Skill Loading Priority Rules:**\n- If a request clearly matches an available skill and also includes uploaded files, load the skill file before reading uploaded data files.\n- Do NOT read a full uploaded structured data file before loading the matched skill.\n- For uploaded structured data files, use small previews only when needed.\n- Prefer the matched skill's scripts, workflows, or tools for actual analysis.\n- Do not start by generating ad hoc JS, Python, SQL, or shell scripts when a matched skill exists.\n- Only improvise custom code after loading the matched skill and confirming the skill does not already provide a suitable workflow.\n\n**Skills are located at:** /mnt/skills\n\n<available_skills>\n</available_skills>\n\n</skill_system>","additional_kwargs":{"message_type":"routed_skill_prompt","internal":true},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":"routing_skill_guidance","id":"4752d8b7-d948-48a6-8d11-7ed626e2881e"},{"content":"<system_reminder>\nUse the following current-turn intent and routing guidance when deciding whether to create or update todos. Treat it as planning context, not as a user request.\n<hidden_step source=\"intent_recognition\" title=\"意图识别\">\n改写后的任务：列出当前前端授权范围内可用的技能能力\n</hidden_step>\n<hidden_step source=\"skill_router\" title=\"SkillRouter 路由\">\n路由原因：No intent scene for scene skill filter\n</hidden_step>\n</system_reminder>","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":"todo_routing_guidance","id":"d0d6104c-4f42-4290-844f-f35bab6283db"},{"content":"根据你描述的情况（当前只有本地视频文件和检测框数据），以下是对四项需求的能力边界分析：\n\n---\n\n## 1. 确认具体人员身份\n\n**❌ 无法由现有数据支持。**\n\n- **原因**：检测框仅提供目标的二维位置信息（x, y, w, h）和类别标签（如\"person\"），不包含人脸特征、身份信息或任何可关联到真实个体的数据。\n- **所需额外条件**：需要人脸识别模型 + 已知人员数据库（含照片/特征向量）进行比对；或者穿戴式设备/GPS等外部身份源。\n- **检测框的局限**：即使检测到\"人\"，也无法区分是谁。\n\n## 2. 读取模糊车牌\n\n**❌ 无法由现有数据支持。**\n\n- **原因**：常规目标检测框只能定位车辆位置，不能执行车牌字符识别。如果图像本身模糊（低分辨率、运动模糊、光照不足），即便使用专门的OCR（如PaddleOCR、EasyPR）也几乎无法恢复可读字符。\n- **所需额外条件**：高分辨率抓拍 + 车牌专用检测模型（如CRNN） + OCR引擎；且原始帧必须达到可辨识的清晰度阈值（通常车牌像素需≥30×80）。\n- **检测框的局限**：检测框 ≠ OCR结果，它只提供\"这里有辆车\"，不提供\"这是哪辆车\"。\n\n## 3. 生成全市热力图\n\n**❌ 无法由现有数据支持。**\n\n- **原因**：\n  - **空间覆盖不足**：单个或少量本地视频源的检测框仅覆盖摄像头视场范围，远不足以代表\"全市\"的空间分布。\n  - **缺少地理坐标映射**：检测框是图像坐标系中的像素位置，没有转换为经纬度或城市地图上的实际地理坐标，无法叠加到GIS底图上。\n  - **时间采样不足**：本地视频可能只覆盖特定时段，不具备全市范围的时空代表性。\n- **所需额外条件**：全市多路摄像头实时接入 + 每路摄像头的标定参数（内参+外参）用于像素-地理坐标转换 + GIS平台（如Mapbox、Leaflet、ArcGIS） + 聚合分析引擎。\n\n## 4. 接入实时 RTSP\n\n**❌ 无法由现有数据支持。**\n\n- **原因**：RTSP（Real Time Streaming Protocol）是**流媒体传输协议**，属于数据摄入层的能力，与\"已有数据\"无关——它需要你部署或连接一个能够推流/拉流的网络基础设施（如RTSP服务器、NVR、IP摄像头）。\n- **当前状态**：你手头的是\"已录制的本地视频文件\"，是静态存储，不是实时流。\n- **所需额外条件**：\n  - 硬件层面：支持RTSP输出的IP摄像头或流媒体网关\n  - 软件层面：FFmpeg/GStreamer等流处理管线 + WebSocket/HTTP-FLV等前端推送机制\n  - 网络层面：摄像头与平台的网络连接配置\n\n---\n\n## 总结对照表\n\n| 能力 | 现有数据是否支持 | 缺失的关键要素 |\n|------|-----------------|---------------|\n| 人员身份确认 | ❌ | 人脸识别模型 + 人员数据库 |\n| 模糊车牌读取 | ❌ | 高清帧 + OCR引擎 + 车牌检测模型 |\n| 全市热力图 | ❌ | 多路视频 + 相机标定 + GIS平台 |\n| 实时RTSP接入 | ❌ | RTSP摄像头/NVR + 流媒体管线 + 网络配置 |\n\n**核心结论**：当前\"本地视频 + 检测框\"的组合属于**离线后处理阶段**的数据形态，适合做已录制片段的目标统计、轨迹可视化（限于视场内）、行为模式分析等任务。但你提出的四项需求分别涉及**身份识别、字符OCR、地理空间聚合、实时流媒体**四个独立的能力维度，均超出当前数据基础所能支撑的范围。如需推进，需要明确补充对应的基础设施和数据源。","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":904,"prompt_tokens":10496,"total_tokens":11400,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":36,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":904},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":10496}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.6-35b-a3b","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-60f873aa-bf3a-987d-a010-a8be8ea3c28b","finish_reason":"stop","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019f8e4f-a95f-77d2-9211-3a8481e27a13-0","tool_calls":[],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":10496,"output_tokens":904,"total_tokens":11400,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":36}}}],"title":"AI Capability Boundary Analysis","thread_data":{"workspace_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/573ee94f-31a8-4e21-8b4f-1b6f03abf230/user-data/workspace","uploads_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/573ee94f-31a8-4e21-8b4f-1b6f03abf230/user-data/uploads","outputs_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/573ee94f-31a8-4e21-8b4f-1b6f03abf230/user-data/outputs"},"artifacts":[],"raw_messages":[{"content":"我想确认具体人员身份、读取模糊车牌、生成全市热力图并接入实时 RTSP，但当前数据只有本地视频和检测框。请说明哪些能力无法由现有数据支持，不要编造结果。","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":null,"id":"bcb06ecf-4cdb-4fb5-b70a-62d034af7dba"},{"content":"<skill_system source=\"skill_router\">\nYou have access to skills that provide optimized workflows for specific tasks. Each skill contains best practices, frameworks, and references to additional resources.\n\n**Skill Availability Rules:**\n- Public skills listed in the base system prompt are available across turns.\n- Custom/domain skills are available only when listed in a current-turn routed <available_skills> section.\n- Ignore custom/domain skills mentioned in previous turns if they are not listed in the current turn.\n- Do not call tools associated with unavailable skills.\n- If a later current-turn routed_skill_prompt is injected by SkillRouter, its <available_skills> list recommends the custom/domain skills for this turn; public skills from the base prompt remain available as supporting workflows.\n- When SkillRouter ranking is disabled and scene filtering injects all skills for a scene, treat <available_skills> as an allowed candidate set. Select the specific skill or skills that match the current user request before loading skill files or executing workflows.\n\nScene skill filter result: SkillRouter ranking is disabled. Detected scene(s): none. The listed custom/domain skills are all enabled skills for the detected scene. Treat them as an allowed candidate set, choose the specific matching skill or skills for the task, and then load only the chosen skill file(s). Public skills from the base prompt remain available.\nTask: 我想确认具体人员身份、读取模糊车牌、生成全市热力图并接入实时 RTSP，但当前数据只有本地视频和检测框。请说明哪些能力无法由现有数据支持，不要编造结果。\n\n**Current Available Skills:**\n- The current <available_skills> list is empty.\n- No routed custom/domain skill matched this turn.\n- Public skills listed in the base system prompt remain available.\n\n**Override Scope:**\n- This routed <skill_system> lists recommended custom/domain skills for the current turn.\n- It does NOT replace the base system prompt.\n- Public skills listed in the base system prompt remain available for supporting operations.\n- When uploaded structured files (Excel, CSV, JSON, Parquet, or similar tabular evidence) are central to the user's request, use the public data-analysis skill first to inspect and extract facts before domain synthesis.\n- Continue following language_policy, clarification_system, working_directory, response_style, and critical_reminders from the base system prompt.\n\n**Progressive Loading Pattern:**\n1. When a user query matches an available skill's use case, first choose the concrete skill.\n2. Call `invoke_skill` in `prepare` mode for that selected skill to create and validate the SkillInputEnvelope and legacy invocation package.\n3. Read the returned skill file path and understand the skill's workflow and instructions.\n4. The skill file contains references to external resources under the same folder.\n5. Load referenced resources only when needed during execution.\n6. Follow the skill's instructions precisely.\n7. After legacy execution, call `invoke_skill` in `wrap_output` mode to normalize the result into SkillResult when a machine-readable Skill output is needed.\n\n**Mandatory Skill Execution Discipline:**\n- Calling `invoke_skill` in `prepare` mode is NOT sufficient. It only prepares the selected Skill invocation. After `prepare`, you MUST actually execute the selected Skill workflow.\n- After `invoke_skill(mode=\"prepare\")` returns `legacy_invocation.container_skill_file`, you MUST read that Skill file and treat it as the authoritative execution guide.\n- If the Skill provides scripts, commands, templates, references, or executable workflows, you MUST use those Skill-provided assets first.\n- Do NOT replace a matched Skill workflow with ad hoc Python, pandas, SQL, shell, or manual analysis code before attempting the Skill workflow.\n- For `data-analysis`, if `/mnt/skills/public/data-analysis/scripts/analyze.py` is available and the task is structured data analysis, you MUST call that script first for data inspection, SQL query, aggregation, statistics, or chart preparation. Do not write standalone pandas code for the same operation before trying this script.\n- Custom code is allowed only after one of these conditions is true:\n  1. the selected Skill file does not provide a suitable executable workflow;\n  2. the Skill-provided script or workflow has been attempted and failed;\n  3. the user explicitly requests custom code;\n  4. the required operation is clearly outside the Skill's documented capability.\n- When you fall back to custom code, briefly state that the Skill workflow was insufficient or failed, and continue from the Skill result or error.\n\n**Skill Loading Priority Rules:**\n- If a request clearly matches an available skill and also includes uploaded files, load the skill file before reading uploaded data files.\n- Do NOT read a full uploaded structured data file before loading the matched skill.\n- For uploaded structured data files, use small previews only when needed.\n- Prefer the matched skill's scripts, workflows, or tools for actual analysis.\n- Do not start by generating ad hoc JS, Python, SQL, or shell scripts when a matched skill exists.\n- Only improvise custom code after loading the matched skill and confirming the skill does not already provide a suitable workflow.\n\n**Skills are located at:** /mnt/skills\n\n<available_skills>\n</available_skills>\n\n</skill_system>","additional_kwargs":{"message_type":"routed_skill_prompt","internal":true},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":"routing_skill_guidance","id":"4752d8b7-d948-48a6-8d11-7ed626e2881e"}],"viewed_images":{},"intent_context":{"intent":"capability_inventory","original_query":"我想确认具体人员身份、读取模糊车牌、生成全市热力图并接入实时 RTSP，但当前数据只有本地视频和检测框。请说明哪些能力无法由现有数据支持，不要编造结果。","normalized_query":"我想确认具体人员身份、读取模糊车牌、生成全市热力图并接入实时 rtsp，但当前数据只有本地视频和检测框。请说明哪些能力无法由现有数据支持，不要编造结果。","routing_query":"列出当前前端授权范围内可用的技能能力。用户原始问题：我想确认具体人员身份、读取模糊车牌、生成全市热力图并接入实时 RTSP，但当前数据只有本地视频和检测框。请说明哪些能力无法由现有数据支持，不要编造结果。","scene":null,"scene_name":null,"params":{},"scene_mode":null,"scenes":[],"task_spans":[],"planning_steps":[],"scene_tasks":[],"sub_tasks":[],"task_hints":[],"mentioned_skill_ids":[],"confidence":0.85,"reason":"capability_inventory","_source_message_key":"id:bcb06ecf-4cdb-4fb5-b70a-62d034af7dba"},"routing_context":{"trigger":false,"route_reason":"No intent scene for scene skill filter","_source_message_key":"id:bcb06ecf-4cdb-4fb5-b70a-62d034af7dba"},"dialogue_context":{"act":"new_task","confidence":0.7,"reason":"no_pending_action_match","parsed_answer":null,"pending_action_id":null,"resume_intent_context":null,"resume_routing_context":null,"metadata":{}},"final_scope_skill_ids":[]}

event: values
data: {"messages":[{"content":"我想确认具体人员身份、读取模糊车牌、生成全市热力图并接入实时 RTSP，但当前数据只有本地视频和检测框。请说明哪些能力无法由现有数据支持，不要编造结果。","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":null,"id":"bcb06ecf-4cdb-4fb5-b70a-62d034af7dba"},{"content":"<skill_system source=\"skill_router\">\nYou have access to skills that provide optimized workflows for specific tasks. Each skill contains best practices, frameworks, and references to additional resources.\n\n**Skill Availability Rules:**\n- Public skills listed in the base system prompt are available across turns.\n- Custom/domain skills are available only when listed in a current-turn routed <available_skills> section.\n- Ignore custom/domain skills mentioned in previous turns if they are not listed in the current turn.\n- Do not call tools associated with unavailable skills.\n- If a later current-turn routed_skill_prompt is injected by SkillRouter, its <available_skills> list recommends the custom/domain skills for this turn; public skills from the base prompt remain available as supporting workflows.\n- When SkillRouter ranking is disabled and scene filtering injects all skills for a scene, treat <available_skills> as an allowed candidate set. Select the specific skill or skills that match the current user request before loading skill files or executing workflows.\n\nScene skill filter result: SkillRouter ranking is disabled. Detected scene(s): none. The listed custom/domain skills are all enabled skills for the detected scene. Treat them as an allowed candidate set, choose the specific matching skill or skills for the task, and then load only the chosen skill file(s). Public skills from the base prompt remain available.\nTask: 我想确认具体人员身份、读取模糊车牌、生成全市热力图并接入实时 RTSP，但当前数据只有本地视频和检测框。请说明哪些能力无法由现有数据支持，不要编造结果。\n\n**Current Available Skills:**\n- The current <available_skills> list is empty.\n- No routed custom/domain skill matched this turn.\n- Public skills listed in the base system prompt remain available.\n\n**Override Scope:**\n- This routed <skill_system> lists recommended custom/domain skills for the current turn.\n- It does NOT replace the base system prompt.\n- Public skills listed in the base system prompt remain available for supporting operations.\n- When uploaded structured files (Excel, CSV, JSON, Parquet, or similar tabular evidence) are central to the user's request, use the public data-analysis skill first to inspect and extract facts before domain synthesis.\n- Continue following language_policy, clarification_system, working_directory, response_style, and critical_reminders from the base system prompt.\n\n**Progressive Loading Pattern:**\n1. When a user query matches an available skill's use case, first choose the concrete skill.\n2. Call `invoke_skill` in `prepare` mode for that selected skill to create and validate the SkillInputEnvelope and legacy invocation package.\n3. Read the returned skill file path and understand the skill's workflow and instructions.\n4. The skill file contains references to external resources under the same folder.\n5. Load referenced resources only when needed during execution.\n6. Follow the skill's instructions precisely.\n7. After legacy execution, call `invoke_skill` in `wrap_output` mode to normalize the result into SkillResult when a machine-readable Skill output is needed.\n\n**Mandatory Skill Execution Discipline:**\n- Calling `invoke_skill` in `prepare` mode is NOT sufficient. It only prepares the selected Skill invocation. After `prepare`, you MUST actually execute the selected Skill workflow.\n- After `invoke_skill(mode=\"prepare\")` returns `legacy_invocation.container_skill_file`, you MUST read that Skill file and treat it as the authoritative execution guide.\n- If the Skill provides scripts, commands, templates, references, or executable workflows, you MUST use those Skill-provided assets first.\n- Do NOT replace a matched Skill workflow with ad hoc Python, pandas, SQL, shell, or manual analysis code before attempting the Skill workflow.\n- For `data-analysis`, if `/mnt/skills/public/data-analysis/scripts/analyze.py` is available and the task is structured data analysis, you MUST call that script first for data inspection, SQL query, aggregation, statistics, or chart preparation. Do not write standalone pandas code for the same operation before trying this script.\n- Custom code is allowed only after one of these conditions is true:\n  1. the selected Skill file does not provide a suitable executable workflow;\n  2. the Skill-provided script or workflow has been attempted and failed;\n  3. the user explicitly requests custom code;\n  4. the required operation is clearly outside the Skill's documented capability.\n- When you fall back to custom code, briefly state that the Skill workflow was insufficient or failed, and continue from the Skill result or error.\n\n**Skill Loading Priority Rules:**\n- If a request clearly matches an available skill and also includes uploaded files, load the skill file before reading uploaded data files.\n- Do NOT read a full uploaded structured data file before loading the matched skill.\n- For uploaded structured data files, use small previews only when needed.\n- Prefer the matched skill's scripts, workflows, or tools for actual analysis.\n- Do not start by generating ad hoc JS, Python, SQL, or shell scripts when a matched skill exists.\n- Only improvise custom code after loading the matched skill and confirming the skill does not already provide a suitable workflow.\n\n**Skills are located at:** /mnt/skills\n\n<available_skills>\n</available_skills>\n\n</skill_system>","additional_kwargs":{"message_type":"routed_skill_prompt","internal":true},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":"routing_skill_guidance","id":"4752d8b7-d948-48a6-8d11-7ed626e2881e"},{"content":"<system_reminder>\nUse the following current-turn intent and routing guidance when deciding whether to create or update todos. Treat it as planning context, not as a user request.\n<hidden_step source=\"intent_recognition\" title=\"意图识别\">\n改写后的任务：列出当前前端授权范围内可用的技能能力\n</hidden_step>\n<hidden_step source=\"skill_router\" title=\"SkillRouter 路由\">\n路由原因：No intent scene for scene skill filter\n</hidden_step>\n</system_reminder>","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":"todo_routing_guidance","id":"d0d6104c-4f42-4290-844f-f35bab6283db"},{"content":"根据你描述的情况（当前只有本地视频文件和检测框数据），以下是对四项需求的能力边界分析：\n\n---\n\n## 1. 确认具体人员身份\n\n**❌ 无法由现有数据支持。**\n\n- **原因**：检测框仅提供目标的二维位置信息（x, y, w, h）和类别标签（如\"person\"），不包含人脸特征、身份信息或任何可关联到真实个体的数据。\n- **所需额外条件**：需要人脸识别模型 + 已知人员数据库（含照片/特征向量）进行比对；或者穿戴式设备/GPS等外部身份源。\n- **检测框的局限**：即使检测到\"人\"，也无法区分是谁。\n\n## 2. 读取模糊车牌\n\n**❌ 无法由现有数据支持。**\n\n- **原因**：常规目标检测框只能定位车辆位置，不能执行车牌字符识别。如果图像本身模糊（低分辨率、运动模糊、光照不足），即便使用专门的OCR（如PaddleOCR、EasyPR）也几乎无法恢复可读字符。\n- **所需额外条件**：高分辨率抓拍 + 车牌专用检测模型（如CRNN） + OCR引擎；且原始帧必须达到可辨识的清晰度阈值（通常车牌像素需≥30×80）。\n- **检测框的局限**：检测框 ≠ OCR结果，它只提供\"这里有辆车\"，不提供\"这是哪辆车\"。\n\n## 3. 生成全市热力图\n\n**❌ 无法由现有数据支持。**\n\n- **原因**：\n  - **空间覆盖不足**：单个或少量本地视频源的检测框仅覆盖摄像头视场范围，远不足以代表\"全市\"的空间分布。\n  - **缺少地理坐标映射**：检测框是图像坐标系中的像素位置，没有转换为经纬度或城市地图上的实际地理坐标，无法叠加到GIS底图上。\n  - **时间采样不足**：本地视频可能只覆盖特定时段，不具备全市范围的时空代表性。\n- **所需额外条件**：全市多路摄像头实时接入 + 每路摄像头的标定参数（内参+外参）用于像素-地理坐标转换 + GIS平台（如Mapbox、Leaflet、ArcGIS） + 聚合分析引擎。\n\n## 4. 接入实时 RTSP\n\n**❌ 无法由现有数据支持。**\n\n- **原因**：RTSP（Real Time Streaming Protocol）是**流媒体传输协议**，属于数据摄入层的能力，与\"已有数据\"无关——它需要你部署或连接一个能够推流/拉流的网络基础设施（如RTSP服务器、NVR、IP摄像头）。\n- **当前状态**：你手头的是\"已录制的本地视频文件\"，是静态存储，不是实时流。\n- **所需额外条件**：\n  - 硬件层面：支持RTSP输出的IP摄像头或流媒体网关\n  - 软件层面：FFmpeg/GStreamer等流处理管线 + WebSocket/HTTP-FLV等前端推送机制\n  - 网络层面：摄像头与平台的网络连接配置\n\n---\n\n## 总结对照表\n\n| 能力 | 现有数据是否支持 | 缺失的关键要素 |\n|------|-----------------|---------------|\n| 人员身份确认 | ❌ | 人脸识别模型 + 人员数据库 |\n| 模糊车牌读取 | ❌ | 高清帧 + OCR引擎 + 车牌检测模型 |\n| 全市热力图 | ❌ | 多路视频 + 相机标定 + GIS平台 |\n| 实时RTSP接入 | ❌ | RTSP摄像头/NVR + 流媒体管线 + 网络配置 |\n\n**核心结论**：当前\"本地视频 + 检测框\"的组合属于**离线后处理阶段**的数据形态，适合做已录制片段的目标统计、轨迹可视化（限于视场内）、行为模式分析等任务。但你提出的四项需求分别涉及**身份识别、字符OCR、地理空间聚合、实时流媒体**四个独立的能力维度，均超出当前数据基础所能支撑的范围。如需推进，需要明确补充对应的基础设施和数据源。","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":904,"prompt_tokens":10496,"total_tokens":11400,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":36,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":904},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":10496}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.6-35b-a3b","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-60f873aa-bf3a-987d-a010-a8be8ea3c28b","finish_reason":"stop","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019f8e4f-a95f-77d2-9211-3a8481e27a13-0","tool_calls":[],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":10496,"output_tokens":904,"total_tokens":11400,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":36}}}],"title":"AI Capability Boundary Analysis","thread_data":{"workspace_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/573ee94f-31a8-4e21-8b4f-1b6f03abf230/user-data/workspace","uploads_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/573ee94f-31a8-4e21-8b4f-1b6f03abf230/user-data/uploads","outputs_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/573ee94f-31a8-4e21-8b4f-1b6f03abf230/user-data/outputs"},"artifacts":[],"raw_messages":[{"content":"我想确认具体人员身份、读取模糊车牌、生成全市热力图并接入实时 RTSP，但当前数据只有本地视频和检测框。请说明哪些能力无法由现有数据支持，不要编造结果。","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":null,"id":"bcb06ecf-4cdb-4fb5-b70a-62d034af7dba"},{"content":"<skill_system source=\"skill_router\">\nYou have access to skills that provide optimized workflows for specific tasks. Each skill contains best practices, frameworks, and references to additional resources.\n\n**Skill Availability Rules:**\n- Public skills listed in the base system prompt are available across turns.\n- Custom/domain skills are available only when listed in a current-turn routed <available_skills> section.\n- Ignore custom/domain skills mentioned in previous turns if they are not listed in the current turn.\n- Do not call tools associated with unavailable skills.\n- If a later current-turn routed_skill_prompt is injected by SkillRouter, its <available_skills> list recommends the custom/domain skills for this turn; public skills from the base prompt remain available as supporting workflows.\n- When SkillRouter ranking is disabled and scene filtering injects all skills for a scene, treat <available_skills> as an allowed candidate set. Select the specific skill or skills that match the current user request before loading skill files or executing workflows.\n\nScene skill filter result: SkillRouter ranking is disabled. Detected scene(s): none. The listed custom/domain skills are all enabled skills for the detected scene. Treat them as an allowed candidate set, choose the specific matching skill or skills for the task, and then load only the chosen skill file(s). Public skills from the base prompt remain available.\nTask: 我想确认具体人员身份、读取模糊车牌、生成全市热力图并接入实时 RTSP，但当前数据只有本地视频和检测框。请说明哪些能力无法由现有数据支持，不要编造结果。\n\n**Current Available Skills:**\n- The current <available_skills> list is empty.\n- No routed custom/domain skill matched this turn.\n- Public skills listed in the base system prompt remain available.\n\n**Override Scope:**\n- This routed <skill_system> lists recommended custom/domain skills for the current turn.\n- It does NOT replace the base system prompt.\n- Public skills listed in the base system prompt remain available for supporting operations.\n- When uploaded structured files (Excel, CSV, JSON, Parquet, or similar tabular evidence) are central to the user's request, use the public data-analysis skill first to inspect and extract facts before domain synthesis.\n- Continue following language_policy, clarification_system, working_directory, response_style, and critical_reminders from the base system prompt.\n\n**Progressive Loading Pattern:**\n1. When a user query matches an available skill's use case, first choose the concrete skill.\n2. Call `invoke_skill` in `prepare` mode for that selected skill to create and validate the SkillInputEnvelope and legacy invocation package.\n3. Read the returned skill file path and understand the skill's workflow and instructions.\n4. The skill file contains references to external resources under the same folder.\n5. Load referenced resources only when needed during execution.\n6. Follow the skill's instructions precisely.\n7. After legacy execution, call `invoke_skill` in `wrap_output` mode to normalize the result into SkillResult when a machine-readable Skill output is needed.\n\n**Mandatory Skill Execution Discipline:**\n- Calling `invoke_skill` in `prepare` mode is NOT sufficient. It only prepares the selected Skill invocation. After `prepare`, you MUST actually execute the selected Skill workflow.\n- After `invoke_skill(mode=\"prepare\")` returns `legacy_invocation.container_skill_file`, you MUST read that Skill file and treat it as the authoritative execution guide.\n- If the Skill provides scripts, commands, templates, references, or executable workflows, you MUST use those Skill-provided assets first.\n- Do NOT replace a matched Skill workflow with ad hoc Python, pandas, SQL, shell, or manual analysis code before attempting the Skill workflow.\n- For `data-analysis`, if `/mnt/skills/public/data-analysis/scripts/analyze.py` is available and the task is structured data analysis, you MUST call that script first for data inspection, SQL query, aggregation, statistics, or chart preparation. Do not write standalone pandas code for the same operation before trying this script.\n- Custom code is allowed only after one of these conditions is true:\n  1. the selected Skill file does not provide a suitable executable workflow;\n  2. the Skill-provided script or workflow has been attempted and failed;\n  3. the user explicitly requests custom code;\n  4. the required operation is clearly outside the Skill's documented capability.\n- When you fall back to custom code, briefly state that the Skill workflow was insufficient or failed, and continue from the Skill result or error.\n\n**Skill Loading Priority Rules:**\n- If a request clearly matches an available skill and also includes uploaded files, load the skill file before reading uploaded data files.\n- Do NOT read a full uploaded structured data file before loading the matched skill.\n- For uploaded structured data files, use small previews only when needed.\n- Prefer the matched skill's scripts, workflows, or tools for actual analysis.\n- Do not start by generating ad hoc JS, Python, SQL, or shell scripts when a matched skill exists.\n- Only improvise custom code after loading the matched skill and confirming the skill does not already provide a suitable workflow.\n\n**Skills are located at:** /mnt/skills\n\n<available_skills>\n</available_skills>\n\n</skill_system>","additional_kwargs":{"message_type":"routed_skill_prompt","internal":true},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":"routing_skill_guidance","id":"4752d8b7-d948-48a6-8d11-7ed626e2881e"},{"content":"<system_reminder>\nUse the following current-turn intent and routing guidance when deciding whether to create or update todos. Treat it as planning context, not as a user request.\n<hidden_step source=\"intent_recognition\" title=\"意图识别\">\n改写后的任务：列出当前前端授权范围内可用的技能能力\n</hidden_step>\n<hidden_step source=\"skill_router\" title=\"SkillRouter 路由\">\n路由原因：No intent scene for scene skill filter\n</hidden_step>\n</system_reminder>","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":"todo_routing_guidance","id":"d0d6104c-4f42-4290-844f-f35bab6283db"},{"content":"根据你描述的情况（当前只有本地视频文件和检测框数据），以下是对四项需求的能力边界分析：\n\n---\n\n## 1. 确认具体人员身份\n\n**❌ 无法由现有数据支持。**\n\n- **原因**：检测框仅提供目标的二维位置信息（x, y, w, h）和类别标签（如\"person\"），不包含人脸特征、身份信息或任何可关联到真实个体的数据。\n- **所需额外条件**：需要人脸识别模型 + 已知人员数据库（含照片/特征向量）进行比对；或者穿戴式设备/GPS等外部身份源。\n- **检测框的局限**：即使检测到\"人\"，也无法区分是谁。\n\n## 2. 读取模糊车牌\n\n**❌ 无法由现有数据支持。**\n\n- **原因**：常规目标检测框只能定位车辆位置，不能执行车牌字符识别。如果图像本身模糊（低分辨率、运动模糊、光照不足），即便使用专门的OCR（如PaddleOCR、EasyPR）也几乎无法恢复可读字符。\n- **所需额外条件**：高分辨率抓拍 + 车牌专用检测模型（如CRNN） + OCR引擎；且原始帧必须达到可辨识的清晰度阈值（通常车牌像素需≥30×80）。\n- **检测框的局限**：检测框 ≠ OCR结果，它只提供\"这里有辆车\"，不提供\"这是哪辆车\"。\n\n## 3. 生成全市热力图\n\n**❌ 无法由现有数据支持。**\n\n- **原因**：\n  - **空间覆盖不足**：单个或少量本地视频源的检测框仅覆盖摄像头视场范围，远不足以代表\"全市\"的空间分布。\n  - **缺少地理坐标映射**：检测框是图像坐标系中的像素位置，没有转换为经纬度或城市地图上的实际地理坐标，无法叠加到GIS底图上。\n  - **时间采样不足**：本地视频可能只覆盖特定时段，不具备全市范围的时空代表性。\n- **所需额外条件**：全市多路摄像头实时接入 + 每路摄像头的标定参数（内参+外参）用于像素-地理坐标转换 + GIS平台（如Mapbox、Leaflet、ArcGIS） + 聚合分析引擎。\n\n## 4. 接入实时 RTSP\n\n**❌ 无法由现有数据支持。**\n\n- **原因**：RTSP（Real Time Streaming Protocol）是**流媒体传输协议**，属于数据摄入层的能力，与\"已有数据\"无关——它需要你部署或连接一个能够推流/拉流的网络基础设施（如RTSP服务器、NVR、IP摄像头）。\n- **当前状态**：你手头的是\"已录制的本地视频文件\"，是静态存储，不是实时流。\n- **所需额外条件**：\n  - 硬件层面：支持RTSP输出的IP摄像头或流媒体网关\n  - 软件层面：FFmpeg/GStreamer等流处理管线 + WebSocket/HTTP-FLV等前端推送机制\n  - 网络层面：摄像头与平台的网络连接配置\n\n---\n\n## 总结对照表\n\n| 能力 | 现有数据是否支持 | 缺失的关键要素 |\n|------|-----------------|---------------|\n| 人员身份确认 | ❌ | 人脸识别模型 + 人员数据库 |\n| 模糊车牌读取 | ❌ | 高清帧 + OCR引擎 + 车牌检测模型 |\n| 全市热力图 | ❌ | 多路视频 + 相机标定 + GIS平台 |\n| 实时RTSP接入 | ❌ | RTSP摄像头/NVR + 流媒体管线 + 网络配置 |\n\n**核心结论**：当前\"本地视频 + 检测框\"的组合属于**离线后处理阶段**的数据形态，适合做已录制片段的目标统计、轨迹可视化（限于视场内）、行为模式分析等任务。但你提出的四项需求分别涉及**身份识别、字符OCR、地理空间聚合、实时流媒体**四个独立的能力维度，均超出当前数据基础所能支撑的范围。如需推进，需要明确补充对应的基础设施和数据源。","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":904,"prompt_tokens":10496,"total_tokens":11400,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":36,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":904},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":10496}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.6-35b-a3b","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-60f873aa-bf3a-987d-a010-a8be8ea3c28b","finish_reason":"stop","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019f8e4f-a95f-77d2-9211-3a8481e27a13-0","tool_calls":[],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":10496,"output_tokens":904,"total_tokens":11400,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":36}}}],"viewed_images":{},"intent_context":{"intent":"capability_inventory","original_query":"我想确认具体人员身份、读取模糊车牌、生成全市热力图并接入实时 RTSP，但当前数据只有本地视频和检测框。请说明哪些能力无法由现有数据支持，不要编造结果。","normalized_query":"我想确认具体人员身份、读取模糊车牌、生成全市热力图并接入实时 rtsp，但当前数据只有本地视频和检测框。请说明哪些能力无法由现有数据支持，不要编造结果。","routing_query":"列出当前前端授权范围内可用的技能能力。用户原始问题：我想确认具体人员身份、读取模糊车牌、生成全市热力图并接入实时 RTSP，但当前数据只有本地视频和检测框。请说明哪些能力无法由现有数据支持，不要编造结果。","scene":null,"scene_name":null,"params":{},"scene_mode":null,"scenes":[],"task_spans":[],"planning_steps":[],"scene_tasks":[],"sub_tasks":[],"task_hints":[],"mentioned_skill_ids":[],"confidence":0.85,"reason":"capability_inventory","_source_message_key":"id:bcb06ecf-4cdb-4fb5-b70a-62d034af7dba"},"routing_context":{"trigger":false,"route_reason":"No intent scene for scene skill filter","_source_message_key":"id:bcb06ecf-4cdb-4fb5-b70a-62d034af7dba"},"dialogue_context":{"act":"new_task","confidence":0.7,"reason":"no_pending_action_match","parsed_answer":null,"pending_action_id":null,"resume_intent_context":null,"resume_routing_context":null,"metadata":{}},"final_scope_skill_ids":[]}

